//
// A separate file because these measure something the other command files
// cannot: DISCRIMINATION BETWEEN THE TWO ACTIONS. With only two capabilities in
// the catalog, an aggregate precision number can look healthy while the model
// systematically resolves every navigation request into a half-filled
// generate_assessment. Per-action precision is reported for exactly this reason,
// and these are its denominator.
//
// `effect: read` rather than `draft`, so these also exercise the other branch of
// the policy's effect ceiling.

